      },
      "message": "feat(verify): later setups judge rapids and entries against the carried body\n\nWhen a setup is entered with a body carried from earlier setups, the\njob's stock becomes the box enclosing the declared stock and the\ncarried body wherever that body stands outside the declared stock, so\nthe rapid, entry, reach and linking laws never see less material than\nis really there. The mismatch rides the path as a named note. Declared\nmaterial past the carried block is judged present: neither verify's\nprior nor the rest mask is read there. A carry the lattice refuses\nrefuses every op of the setup, and a posed op there digests the rest\nchain.\n\nFixes #319\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
